1
00:00:00,656 --> 00:00:02,826
(Sheldon:)...and at least one year
of algebraic topology?

2
00:00:02,992 --> 00:00:04,452
Well, here come the jokes.

3
00:00:06,204 --> 00:00:09,624
(Sheldon:)Why did the chicken
cross the Mobius strip?

4
00:00:09,791 --> 00:00:12,631
To get to the same side?
Buzzinga.

5
00:00:14,170 --> 00:00:17,010
(Sheldon:)A neutron walks into a bar and asks,
"How much for a drink?"

6
00:00:17,215 --> 00:00:20,595
(Sheldon:)The bartender says,
"For you, no charge."

7
00:00:25,223 --> 00:00:28,013
(Sheldon:)Hello? I know you're out there.

8
00:00:28,184 --> 00:00:32,484
(Sheldon:)I can hear you metabolizing oxygen
and expelling carbon dioxide.

9
00:00:33,356 --> 00:00:36,486
It looks like we have some
academic dignitaries in the audience.

10
00:00:36,651 --> 00:00:39,531
(Sheldon:)Dr. Randall
from the geology department...

11
00:00:39,695 --> 00:00:42,195
(Sheldon:)...only man who's happy
when they take his work for granite.

12
00:00:42,365 --> 00:00:44,155
Bada-cha.

13
00:00:46,327 --> 00:00:48,157
(Sheldon:)I kid the geologists, of course...

14
00:00:48,329 --> 00:00:51,169
...but it's only because
I have no respect for the field.

15
00:00:52,375 --> 00:00:58,025
(Sheldon:)Let's get serious for a moment.

